#. module: sn_wsd_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_partner.field_sn_wsd_supplier_group__code
msgid ""
"Code prefixed to the supplier code, e.g. 01 for the electronic components "
"group. Two digits by convention; each code may exist once."
msgstr "供应商编码的前置位，例如电子元器件类为 01。按惯例为两位；每个编码只能出现一次。"

